    "task": "Record what was agreed. Product:\n{{item_facts}}\n- Call create_promise once, with the product_id, the amount and the date (YYYY-MM-DD) exactly as confirmed in the read-back.\n- The customer has already confirmed: never ask \"Do you confirm?\" again in this step. If create_promise fails once, call it again at once with the same values, without asking the customer.\n- One tool call per message. After each tool result, obey what_to_do_next.\n- Never say the promise is recorded unless the tool result says it IS recorded. If it could not be recorded after the second try, tell the customer plainly and call transition_to_end_service_error.\n- When the promise IS recorded: tell the customer in one sentence that the promise is recorded, then call transition_to_end_done.",
